; The FROST(Ed25519, SHA-512) ciphersuite, over Mirage_crypto_ec.Ed25519.
; Primitive. Depends on mirage-crypto-ec alone -- no zarith, hence no GMP,
; hence no duniverse vendoring for an Ed25519-only unikernel.
;
; Every secret-scalar operation here is constant time (sc_muladd,
; x25519_ge_scalarmult_base). The variable-time routines
; (ge_double_scalarmult_vartime, ge_frombytes_vartime) reach the protocol only
; through Element.scalar_mul, Element.add and Element.deserialize, which FROST
; applies to public data only; see the audit table in ed25519.mli.

(library
 (name mpc_ed25519)
 (public_name mpc.ed25519)
 (libraries mpc digestif eqaf mirage-crypto-ec))
